deficiencies that make HVAC equipment work harder than necessary. Right-sized modern equipment in a coordinated upgrade strategy can deliver comfort and efficiency that keeps mid-century housing functional for generations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/contact\/\">Talk to Our Team Today<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"s-credits has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Photos: &quot;Basement&quot; by Martin Cathrae, BY-SA, via Openverse \u00b7 &quot;20110719-RD-LSC-0205&quot; by USDAgov, BY, via Openverse \u00b7 &quot;Ductless Mini Split Heat Pump Installation&quot; by Vernon Air Con, BY-SA, via Openverse<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>New Castle mid-century home HVAC: addressing original equipment nearing 40-50 years old, oversized furnaces, ductwork deficiencies, and coordinated replacements.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":0,"featured_media":1477,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"location","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"_angie_page":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-166","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.0 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>New Castle&#039;s Mid-Century Furnaces Were Oversized From Day One - Keystone Comfort Co.<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"New Castle mid-century home HVAC: addressing original equipment nearing 40-50 years old, oversized furnaces, ductwork deficiencies, and coordinated replacements.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href